{
  "slug": "datadops",
  "name": "Datadops",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "DatadOps is an Intelligent advanced Datadog workflows for Claude Code .\nIt transforms raw monitoring data into actionable insights through intelligent DatadOps automation.\nThis is a lightweight wrapper plugin that adds intelligent workflows on top of the official Datadog MCP server. While the official server provides access to raw Datadog data, this plugin orchestrates that data into complete operational workflows.\n- Service Health Dashboards\n- Incident Response Automation\n- Performance Investigation\n- Deployment Validation",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `deployment-health-check` (Automated post-deployment health verification using Datadog metrics, logs, and APM data), `incident-response` (Comprehensive incident response workflow using Datadog observability data), `performance-investigation` (Deep performance analysis using APM traces, metrics, and logs to identify bottlenecks and optimization opportunities), `service-health-overview` (Quick service health assessment providing a comprehensive overview of current service status using key metrics, active alerts, and…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `datadog`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install datadops@claude-community` from `ahmidbbc/datadops`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
